# 🚨 CURSOR AGENT RULES - SINGLE SOURCE OF TRUTH

## MANDATORY FOR ALL CURSOR AGENTS

### 🔴 CRITICAL: Read Master Rules

**BEFORE ANY WORK:**
1. Read `.cursor/rules/MASTER-RULES-INDEX.mdc` (MASTER INDEX & SINGLE SOURCE OF TRUTH)
2. Check branch: `git branch --show-current`
3. Pull latest: `git pull origin beta`

### Quick Reference

**Complete rules are in**: `.cursor/rules/MASTER-RULES-INDEX.mdc` (master index with focused modules)

**Key points**:
- ✅ Feature branches with PRs (not direct beta commits)
- ✅ Bash validation on push (auto-fix errors, batched)
- ✅ Automated merge with conflict resolution
- ✅ Sequential PR merging (one at a time)
- ✅ Immediate feedback in chat (informational only)
- ✅ **Batching**: All fixes collected → Single commit → Single push (clean build tree)

### When in Doubt

**STOP. READ MASTER-RULES-INDEX.mdc. ASK USER. WAIT FOR APPROVAL.**

---

**These rules are MANDATORY and STRICTLY ENFORCED.**
**Cursor IDE will monitor compliance.**
